@startuml
title cti-expert — /webpivot + correlation + premium API-key workflow
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #34495E
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #2C6FBB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3D6
  DiamondBorderColor #C8901F
  StartColor #2C6FBB
  EndColor #2C6FBB
}

start
:**/webpivot URL**   or   **/case DOMAIN**;
:**pivot_extract.py**\nfetch page (or saved DOM) + extract artifacts\n(favicon mmh3/md5, GA / GTM / AdSense,\nwallets, SaaS operator tokens, emails);
:**enrich_live()**;

fork
  :**KEYLESS baseline — ALWAYS runs**\ncrt.sh (CT) · HackerTarget passive DNS\n· anonymous urlscan;
fork again
  if (premium API key present?\nresolve order: ENV var -> skill .env) then (key set)
    :**PREMIUM enrichers**  (only the keys you set)\nShodan (favicon mmh3 + cert SHA-256)\nCensys (favicon MD5 + cert SHA-256) · FOFA\nDNSLytics (GA/AdSense -> sibling domains)\nSecurityTrails · urlscan-PRO · WhoisXML\nBlockchair / Subscan (wallet balance + flow);
  else (no key)
    :skip premium\nkeyless leads only (identical to before);
  endif
end fork

:**ranked pivots + live_results**  (high -> low confidence);
:**correlate — keyless**\nrank_relations.py: score same-operator siblings + drop noise\ncert_pivot.py: cert fingerprint + SAN siblings\npivot_suggest.py: ranked next-pivots\ncrypto_balance · email_hygiene · sensitive_paths;
:save to case workspace   raw/<host>.json;
:**graph_build.py**\ncluster hosts into one network graph\n(shared favicon / GA / wallet hubs + ranked sibling edges);
stop

legend right
  **Key store — managed by /apikeys**
  ====
  .env at ~/.claude/skills/cti-expert/.env
  chmod 600 · gitignored · ENV var overrides it
  ----
  Add a key:   /apikeys set censys <KEY>
  Check:       /apikeys status | test | unlocks
  ----
  Keyless correlation tools:
  /rank-relations · /cert-pivot · /pivot-suggest
  /crypto-balance · /email-hygiene · /sensitive-paths
  ----
  No keys set  ->  everything runs keyless / free
endlegend
@enduml
